       This documentation is primarily aimed at provider authors. See
       pprroovviiddeerr(7) for further information.

       The signature (OSSL_OP_SIGNATURE) operation enables providers to
       implement signature algorithms and make them available to applications
       via the API functions EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__ssiiggnn(3), EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__vveerriiffyy(3), and
       EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__vveerriiffyy__rreeccoovveerr(3) (as well as other related functions).

